rights.body:
Depending on where you live (for example under the GDPR in the EU), you have the right to:

- know what we hold about you and get a copy, in a portable format;
- have it corrected if it is wrong;
- have it deleted;
- object to or restrict how we use it;
- withdraw your consent at any time, without affecting what was done before, with Cookie settings at the bottom of the page;
- complain to your data protection authority.

To use any of these rights, write to us (see [Contact](#section-contact)). We answer within one month.
